  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ARMORED CORE Ⅵ FIRES OF RUBICON』のアイテムが『30 MINUTES MISSIONS』シリーズで商品化。",
      "en": "\"ARMORED CORE Ⅵ FIRES OF RUBICON \" items are commercialized in the \" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "シリーズのキーコンセプト「シンプル組み立て」「カスタム遊び」のもと、オーネスト・ブルートゥが操る「ミルクトゥース」が登場。",
      "en": "Based on the series' key concepts of \"simple assembly \" and \" custom play,\" \" Milktooth\", operated by Honest Bluetooth, is now available."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部、コア、腕部、脚部それぞれにシリーズ共通構造を採用し、ゲーム内同様に「アセンブル」をプラモデルで楽しめる。",
      "en": "• The head, core, arms, and legs each use the same structure as the series, allowing you to enjoy \"assembling\" the plastic model just like in the game."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 両肩武器と一部左手武器の取り付けには3mmジョイントを採用し様々なアセンブルに対応可能。",
      "en": "• 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-handed weapons, allowing for a variety of assemblies."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武器は「WB-0000 BAD COOK」「WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE」「BML-G2/P19SPL-12」「SB-033M MORLEY」が付属。",
      "en": "• Weapons include \"WB-0000 BAD COOK \", \" WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE \", \" BML-G2/P19SPL-12 \", and \" SB-033M MORLEY\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE」のチェーンソーは格納状態と展開状態の2種類が付属。",
      "en": "• \"WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE\" chainsaw comes in two types: retracted state and expanded state."
    }
  ],
